    {
      "caseId": 112,
      "kannadaNarrative": "ಕೊಪ್ಪಳದಲ್ಲಿ ೦೧-೧೨-೨೦೨೪ರವರೆಗೆ ಮೂರು ತಿಂಗಳುಗಳ ಅವಧಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ಒಂದು ರಿಟೇಲ್ ಚೈನ್ ನ ಹಣದ collections ಅನ್ನು ಪ್ರತಿ गुरुवಾರ overnight locked ಆಗುತ್ತಿದ್ದ ಕಚೇರಿಯ vault ನಲ್ಲಿ forged ₹೫೦೦ notes ಗಳನ್ನು print ಮಾಡಿ diverted ಮಾಡಲಾಗುತ್ತಿತ್ತು. ಪ್ರತಿ forged instrument ಮೇಲೆ ಒಂದೇ notary stamp ಇತ್ತು.⁠",
      "englishOriginal": "Over three months ending 01-12-2024 in Koppal, a retail chain’s cash collections were routinely diverted by printing fake ₹500 notes in the vault of an office that shut overnight every Thursday. A single notary’s stamp appeared on every forged instrument.⁠",
      "matchedCaseId": 18385,
      "matchedEnglishNarrative": "From 25-01-2025 to 18-04-2025 at a main road office in Ramanagara that closed overnight, an unknown gang operating weekly printed counterfeit ₹500 notes and used the same notary on every forged document to dupe a local retail chain out of ₹2.8 lakh.⁠",
      "matchedScore": 0.877,
      "sameSeries": true,
      "rank": 2
